WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Lie face-down with the arms alongside the body, forehead resting on the mat.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Bend both knees and reach back to hold the outer ankles.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Inhale and kick the ankles into the hands, lifting the chest and thighs off the floor.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Draw the shoulder blades together and lift the gaze softly forward.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Rock gently with the breath if it feels good, then release with control.
